      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Recorded checks (November 16, 2026):\n196 automated tests passed.\nPaired workflows: fork 10/10; upstream 6/10.\nExisting-owner reuse: 8/8 for both.\nDense retrieval: hybrid 34/34 at @10 and @30.\nMemory: 4/4 after 72 exchanges;\nall 215 source events retained.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Recorded checks (November 16, 2026):\n196 automated tests passed.\nPaired workflows: fork 10/10; upstream 6/10.\nExisting-owner reuse: 8/8 for both.\nDense retrieval: hybrid 34/34 at @10 and @30.\nMemory: 4/4 after 72 exchanges;\nall 215 source events retained.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
