      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "mcpInsetLabel": true
      },
      "text": "TERMINOLOGY\n\nInteraction Agent (IA): talks to the user and delegates work.\nExecution Agent (EA): retains an identity, assigned work, and its own history.\nEA run: one execution of an EA. Task: a multi-step operation exposed to an EA as a tool.\nChat memory belongs to the Interaction Agent; execution history belongs to a specific EA.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TERMINOLOGY\n\nInteraction Agent (IA): talks to the user and delegates work.\nExecution Agent (EA): retains an identity, assigned work, and its own history.\nEA run: one execution of an EA. Task: a multi-step operation exposed to an EA as a tool.\nChat memory belongs to the Interaction Agent; execution history belongs to a specific EA.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
