          "style": "excalidraw",
          "accent": "violet",
          "decor": true
        },
        "presenterNotes": "- Timing: about 1.5 minutes.\n- The three problems grow along different dimensions, so each needs its own control.\n- An EA is a saved identity with assigned work and history. An EA run is one execution of that saved agent.\n- A Task in OpenPoke is a multi-step tool operation, such as Search Email. I keep that separate from EA identity.\n- The board groups the changes into discovery, context, and execution."
      },
      "name": "02 — The overload problems"
    },
