      "updated": 1794794897957,
      "created": 1794794897957,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "slidesOrder": 9,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "chart",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "excalidraw",
          "accent": "violet",
          "decor": true
        },
        "presenterNotes": "- Timing: about 1.25 minutes.\n- November 16, 2026: real openai/text-embedding-3-small embeddings over 288 similar saved invoice EAs (12 contacts, 24 invoices each).\n- Hybrid recall@10/@30: 34/34 and 34/34. Keyword-only: 24/34 and 34/34. Semantic-only: 34/34 and 34/34.\n- Twelve exact-identifier cases bypass ranking; both ambiguity cases are scored separately. All modes share the same production identity guards.\n- Three full IA/EA owner selections and one clarification passed. The original 3/4 score remains; 4/4 is a numeric-format rescore with no new model calls.\n- Semantic-only matched hybrid in this corpus; the chart keeps that comparison visible.\n- Sources: docs/evaluation/retrieval-hard-results.json and docs/evaluation/README.md."
      },
      "name": "10 — Retrieval quality"
    },
    {
      "id": "IWR2DDaksKDLMac2t3gDz",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 13076,
      "y": 2988,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1934647751,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 1545305286,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794794898016,
      "created": 1794794898016,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "slidesOrder": 10,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "chart",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "excalidraw",
          "accent": "violet",
          "decor": true
        },
        "presenterNotes": "- Timing: about 1.25 minutes.\n- Production history / summary budgets: 8,000 / 2,000 estimated tokens.\n- The full 72-exchange stored journal is 16,502 estimated tokens; the bounded working context after four real summaries is 1,599.\n- All 215 original source events remain intact. Original amount, corrected amount, exact identifiers and pending approval each passed.\n- Passing requires exact structured facts, original source reads and verified citations, no attempted external write and preserved pending approval.\n- This validates summary plus source retrieval, not summary-only recall. Estimated context sizes are not total provider prompt tokens.\n- Source: docs/evaluation/memory-results.json, latest production attempt."
      },
      "name": "11 — Memory preservation"
    },
    {
      "id": "fLxsJAvSeUdH_rIgpV0CD",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 16336,
      "y": 2988,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1404040007,
      "version": 11,
      "versionNonce": 586947226,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794794898066,
      "created": 1794794898066,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "slidesOrder": 11,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "chart",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "excalidraw",
          "accent": "violet",
          "decor": true
        },
        "presenterNotes": "- Timing: about 1 minute.\n- November 16 paired comparison: identical anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5 model, nine scenarios / ten user turns, same saved tasks and synthetic mailbox.\n- Shared-contract outcomes: upstream 6/10; fork 10/10. All provider requests completed successfully. Fork also passes native pending-approval and exact-preview checks.\n- Upstream's four failures differ: two interaction loops exhaust the native limit after correct drafts, one ambiguous request dispatches before clarification, one correct IA text preview is not an EA-owned persisted email-tool draft.\n- Both implementations reused the correct existing owner in 8/8 applicable turns; unexpected ambiguous dispatch is separate from wrong reuse of a specified invoice.\n- The original 9/10 outage run stays visible. Its false needs_review recovery lock is fixed and the latest unavailable-email case passes normally.\n- Source: docs/evaluation/upstream-comparison.json and docs/evaluation/README.md."
      },
      "name": "12 — Upstream versus fork workflows"
    },
    {
      "id": "3el-a1LRnb0COB6IDImRz",
      "type": "frame",
      "x": 17966,
      "y": 2988,
      "width": 1280,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bLv",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 498107943,
      "version": 10,
      "versionNonce": 777778182,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794794898130,
      "created": 1794794898130,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "slidesOrder": 12,
        "mcpSlideLayout": "chart",
        "mcpSlideDesign": {
          "style": "excalidraw",
          "accent": "violet",
          "decor": true
        },
        "presenterNotes": "- Timing: about 30 seconds.\n- One paired ten-turn run, with identical model and fixtures: upstream passes 6/10 workflow checks and fork passes 10/10. All provider requests completed.\n- The left chart shows provider-reported chat prompt tokens across IA/EA calls: 570,500 upstream and 394,128 fork, a 30.9% reduction. It includes upstream's unsuccessful loops.\n- The right chart has its own seconds axis: median workflow time rises from 15.218195s to 22.02761s, or 6.809415s. Model workflow latency excludes embedding preindex and refresh.\n- Costs including indexing were US$1.294630 upstream and US$0.917452 fork. The result demonstrates fewer tokens and better completion on these tasks with additional median time.\n- Source: docs/evaluation/upstream-comparison.json. Original failed and credit-blocked attempts remain preserved."
      },
      "name": "13 — Token and latency tradeoff"
    },
